# ringserv_core.stage -- what the image of machines/cloud_core.machine + machines/ringserv.pack
# carries beyond /harb: the server, and the application it serves on the core link
# (machines/ringserv/app_core.ring, which listens where another machine can ask it).
# One line each: <file in this repository's tree>  <where the image puts it>.
#
# The server is not in git (experiment/ringserv_build.ps1 makes it, from the source ref
# vendor/PIN.md pins). machines/ringserv.stage is the same list for the loopback-only
# machine of SRV-2, with the application that listens on loopback alone.
zig-out/ringserv/ringserv        /ringserv
machines/ringserv/app_core.ring  /app/app.ring
